 during economic growth phases and become more cautious during downturns.^DIIs can influence market liquidity. Their investment behaviour might also be influenced by interest rate changes, as these affect the returns on different financial instruments.^DIIs often respond to fiscal and monetary policy changes, adjusting their investment strategies based on policy shifts that impact the economy and financial markets."},{"question":"How to interpret the Domestic Institutional Investors (DIIs) Investment in Equities data ?","answer":"DII investment levels reflect the confidence of domestic institutions in the equity market. High investment levels suggest optimism about market prospects, while low levels may indicate caution."}],"related":[{"slug":"10-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (10Y)"},{"slug":"1-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (1Y)"},{"slug":"3-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (3Y)"},{"slug":"5-year-credit-spread-aaa-rated-bonds-g-sec","title":"Credit Spread AAA vs G-Sec (5Y)"},{"slug":"consumer-price-index-cpi-inflation-headline","title":"Consumer Price Index (CPI) Inflation- Headline"},{"slug":"crude-oil-price-indian-basket","title":"Crude Oil Price (Indian Basket)"},{"slug":"foreign-portfolio-investments-fpis-equity","title":"Foreign Portfolio Investments (FPIs) - Equity"},{"slug":"gross-foreign-direct-investment-fdi","title":"Gross Foreign Direct Investment (FDI)"},{"slug":"gross-tax-revenue","title":"Gross Tax Revenue"},{"slug":"mutual-fund-aum-equity","title":"Mutual Fund AUM- Equity"},{"slug":"primary-issuances-in-equity-market","title":"Primary Issuances in Equity Market"},{"slug":"repo-rate","title":"Repo Rate"},{"slug":"usd-inr-exchange-rate","title":"USD/INR Exchange Rate"}],"title":"Domestic Institutional Investors (DIIs) Investment - Equity","description":"Net DII equity investment stands at ₹ 760.3 Billion for Sep 20